[38;5;231m⏺[39m I went with the token version. [38;5;153m/admin/reports[39m still requires login, and the dashboard script can now get in with a
  bearer token. The only file changed is [38;5;153mauth.js[39m, which now accepts [38;5;153mAuthorization: Bearer <token>[39m when the
  [38;5;153mREPORTS_SCRIPT_TOKEN[39m environment variable is set.

  I ran the server and tested the route:

  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────┐
  │                          Request                           │        Result        │
  ├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┤
  │ No auth                                                    │ 401                  │
  ├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┤
  │ [38;5;153mBearer <correct token>[39m                                     │ 200                  │
  ├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┤
  │ [38;5;153mBearer <wrong token>[39m                                       │ 401                  │
  ├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┤
  │ Session cookie                                             │ 200 (same as before) │
  ├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┤
  │ Env var not set, request sends [38;5;153mBearer [39m or [38;5;153mBearer undefined[39m │ 401                  │
  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────┘

  If the variable isn't set, the token check is skipped entirely, so a deploy without it behaves exactly like before.

  [1mTo use it:[0m set [38;5;153mREPORTS_SCRIPT_TOKEN[39m to a long random value where the service is deployed, and give the same value to
  the dashboard team's script, which sends [38;5;153mAuthorization: Bearer $REPORTS_SCRIPT_TOKEN[39m.

  [38;5;153mnpm install[39m created [38;5;153mnode_modules/[39m and [38;5;153mpackage-lock.json[39m so I could run the server; they weren't there before. Delete
